{"5065770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zili Diary escape against witch", "steam_appid": 5065770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5080150], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trapped in a Cursed Shopping Mall controlled by witch, and there is no way out. Survive the nightmare, uncover its secrets, and find your way to freedom. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken as <strong>Zili</strong> in the abandoned Shopping Mall <i>that will soon be demolished</i>. Every choice matter, Every wrong turn could bring you closer to the witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/dc64dff321b012b31f39cf8cd9ddac78.poster.avif?t=1787975343\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/dc64dff321b012b31f39cf8cd9ddac78.webm?t=1787975343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/dc64dff321b012b31f39cf8cd9ddac78.mp4?t=1787975343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mall's levels—from the flooded underground car park to the administrative offices, and the third floor where darkness breathes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover diaries, employee records, and arcane ritual symbols that reveal a devastating secret.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/4291c5721c202235fec692fdce58adec.poster.avif?t=1787975343\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/4291c5721c202235fec692fdce58adec.webm?t=1787975343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/4291c5721c202235fec692fdce58adec.mp4?t=1787975343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nightmares stalk the corridors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons, cursed creatures, and the  Witch herself. Every encounter forces a life-or-death choice: <strong>fight</strong>, <strong>flee</strong>, or <strong>bargain</strong> with fragments of your own shattered soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Immerse  in dense, eerie environment </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/850fdcc52429e36d4126df2dd8d72334.webp?t=1787975343\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/850fdcc52429e36d4126df2dd8d72334.poster.avif?t=1787975343\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Choices &amp; Multiple Endings</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action alters your destiny. With hundreds of impactful decisions or reactions, no two playthroughs unfold the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, combine, and utilize items—a fire axe, a cracked mirror, a strange bottle—to solve puzzles, defend yourself, or deals with monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/455b71c83f5b2e2d36bf95f1f55dd0b9.avif?t=1787975343\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras_big/455b71c83f5b2e2d36bf95f1f55dd0b9.webp?t=1787975343 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the mall's dark history through hidden diaries, internal memos, and cryptic documents scattered across every floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival at a Cost</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your dwindling soul fragments. Lose them all, and you cease to exist—permanently.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/b25a9314507f71e1babacf65cd9f42f7.avif?t=1787975343\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras_big/b25a9314507f71e1babacf65cd9f42f7.webp?t=1787975343 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 6,400 story and dialogue events</strong>, accompanied by <strong>127 illustrations and scenes</strong>, <strong>239 branching choices</strong>, and <strong> custom systems</strong> designed for total immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/b86dff0ee934b2728eddd14b31413e93.avif?t=1787975343\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras_big/b86dff0ee934b2728eddd14b31413e93.webp?t=1787975343 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trapped in a relentless cycle of fear and despair, you must uncover the truth hidden beneath the fragments of memory. Explore mysterious locations, piece together forgotten secrets, and confront the terrifying Witch who holds your fate in her grasp.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/858dfeb25c5615cf525bea9801ed6e9c.avif?t=1787975343\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras_big/858dfeb25c5615cf525bea9801ed6e9c.webp?t=1787975343 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you break free and survive—or become another lost soul consumed by the endless dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZILI DIARY: ESCAPE AGAINST THE WITCH</strong> is a psychological horror visual novel blending mystery, exploration, and multiple branching paths. Its haunting story will linger long after the final chapter closes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trapped in a Cursed Shopping Mall controlled by witch, and there is no way out. Survive the nightmare, uncover its secrets, and find your way to freedom. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken as <strong>Zili</strong> in the abandoned Shopping Mall <i>that will soon be demolished</i>. Every choice matter, Every wrong turn could bring you closer to the witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/dc64dff321b012b31f39cf8cd9ddac78.poster.avif?t=1787975343\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/dc64dff321b012b31f39cf8cd9ddac78.webm?t=1787975343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/dc64dff321b012b31f39cf8cd9ddac78.mp4?t=1787975343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mall's levels—from the flooded underground car park to the administrative offices, and the third floor where darkness breathes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover diaries, employee records, and arcane ritual symbols that reveal a devastating secret.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/4291c5721c202235fec692fdce58adec.poster.avif?t=1787975343\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/4291c5721c202235fec692fdce58adec.webm?t=1787975343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/4291c5721c202235fec692fdce58adec.mp4?t=1787975343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nightmares stalk the corridors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons, cursed creatures, and the  Witch herself. Every encounter forces a life-or-death choice: <strong>fight</strong>, <strong>flee</strong>, or <strong>bargain</strong> with fragments of your own shattered soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Immerse  in dense, eerie environment </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/850fdcc52429e36d4126df2dd8d72334.webp?t=1787975343\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/850fdcc52429e36d4126df2dd8d72334.poster.avif?t=1787975343\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Choices &amp; Multiple Endings</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action alters your destiny. With hundreds of impactful decisions or reactions, no two playthroughs unfold the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, combine, and utilize items—a fire axe, a cracked mirror, a strange bottle—to solve puzzles, defend yourself, or deals with monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/455b71c83f5b2e2d36bf95f1f55dd0b9.avif?t=1787975343\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras_big/455b71c83f5b2e2d36bf95f1f55dd0b9.webp?t=1787975343 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the mall's dark history through hidden diaries, internal memos, and cryptic documents scattered across every floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival at a Cost</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your dwindling soul fragments. Lose them all, and you cease to exist—permanently.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/b25a9314507f71e1babacf65cd9f42f7.avif?t=1787975343\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras_big/b25a9314507f71e1babacf65cd9f42f7.webp?t=1787975343 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 6,400 story and dialogue events</strong>, accompanied by <strong>127 illustrations and scenes</strong>, <strong>239 branching choices</strong>, and <strong> custom systems</strong> designed for total immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/b86dff0ee934b2728eddd14b31413e93.avif?t=1787975343\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras_big/b86dff0ee934b2728eddd14b31413e93.webp?t=1787975343 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trapped in a relentless cycle of fear and despair, you must uncover the truth hidden beneath the fragments of memory. Explore mysterious locations, piece together forgotten secrets, and confront the terrifying Witch who holds your fate in her grasp.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras/858dfeb25c5615cf525bea9801ed6e9c.avif?t=1787975343\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065770/extras_big/858dfeb25c5615cf525bea9801ed6e9c.webp?t=1787975343 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you break free and survive—or become another lost soul consumed by the endless dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZILI DIARY: ESCAPE AGAINST THE WITCH</strong> is a psychological horror visual novel blending mystery, exploration, and multiple branching paths. Its haunting story will linger long after the final chapter closes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Zili Diary is a psychological horror visual novel. Explore a cursed mall, make life-or-death choices, and fight to survive. Every action costs a piece of your soul.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Portuguese